(Semester Study Plan - Fall 2026) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This document describes the courses, schedule, and milestones for the) Tj
T*
(fall semester. It is the primary reference for planning study time) Tj
T*
(and tracking progress toward this semester's learning goals.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Enrolled courses:) Tj
T*
(1. Machine Learning \(CS-401\) - lectures on Tuesdays, lab on Thursdays.) Tj
T*
(2. Database Systems \(CS-330\) - lectures on Mondays and Wednesdays.) Tj
T*
(3. Technical Writing \(ENG-215\) - seminars on Fridays.) Tj
T*
ET
