(Weekly Schedule) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A typical study week is structured as follows. Monday and Wednesday) Tj
T*
(mornings are reserved for Database Systems reading and problem sets.) Tj
T*
(Tuesday is the Machine Learning lecture day, followed by an evening) Tj
T*
(review session. Thursday afternoons are for the ML lab, where the) Tj
T*
(weekly notebook has to be finished and submitted before midnight.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Friday mornings cover Technical Writing; the afternoon is free for) Tj
T*
(the personal software project. Weekends are reserved for rest, one) Tj
T*
(long library session on Saturday, and planning the next week on) Tj
T*
(Sunday evening using this assistant.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
