(Project Tooling Decisions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For the personal assistant project the following tools were chosen.) Tj
T*
(Qdrant was selected as the vector database because it offers a local) Tj
T*
(persistent mode that requires no separately deployed server, and its) Tj
T*
(payload metadata keeps citation information attached to every chunk.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LangGraph is used as the workflow orchestrator, with a persistent) Tj
T*
(SQLite checkpointer so that conversations and pending approvals) Tj
T*
(survive restarts. For embeddings the project uses the local model) Tj
T*
(sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2, which produces 384-dimensional) Tj
T*
(vectors and avoids embedding API charges. Streamlit was picked for the) Tj
T*
(interface because a single developer can maintain it easily.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
